e, es fácil conectar o usar la app JBL PartyBox para conectar de forma inalámbrica varios parlantes JBL compatibles con Auracast. Reúne a las personas y eleva la experiencia con el JBL PartyBox Stage 320.","dept":"audio","retailer":"bestbuy","weightKg":11.948,"weightPub":true}],"knit hanna long cover up (final sale) - sailboat":[{"name":"Knit Hanna Long Cover Up (Final Sale) - Sailboat","brand":"Vix","price":100,"wasPrice":248,"salePct":60,"image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2141/1439/files/VH256013_13.png?v=1775588617","images":["78|","60|.jpg?v=1775588617","59|4.jpg?v=1775588617","59|7.jpg?v=1775588617","59|8.jpg?v=1775588617","59|13_10964332-b237-4698-a894-39665e3cb6cf.png?v=1775588544"],"description":"El ViX Knit Hanna Long Cover Up es una acogedora cubierta de estilo midi con un escote de barco, aberturas profundos de brazo, rendijas laterales, y una silueta relajada y fluida. Combina Hanna Long Cover Up con un bikini y sandalias coincidentes para un look sin esfuerzo junto a la piscina.","dept":"latino_designers","retailer":"vix","weightKg":0.15}],"loosey buckle belt - black":[{"name":"Loosey Buckle Belt - Black","brand":"Loosey","price":41.95,"wasPrice":42,"image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0519/1388/3831/files/BQ993B2-1.jpg?v=1785514784","images":["81|","63|2.jpg?v=1785514786"],"description":"Accesorios Loosey.","dept":"clothing","retailer":"ccs","weightKg":0.17,"weightPub":true}],"maaji tropical haven ela maxi dress":[{"name":"Maaji Tropical Haven Ela Maxi Dress","brand":"Maaji","price":252,"image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0631/5550/3333/files/61nx2XIWtdL.jpg?v=1782481159","images":["83|","66|_7768f861-6794-4b5c-9975-91c72b75df9f.jpg?v=1782481159","67|25581048-52b7-45cc-909b-df8b0c17bf38.jpg?v=1782481160","57|bnoXGFFXL.jpg?v=1782481191","66|_8cea6d62-cbab-40d6-bad7-6a07922a12a9.jpg?v=1782481191","67|c1e85040-b166-4e97-91a2-8e5830e5d539.jpg?v=1782481160","55|81RYURDXTtL.jpg?v=1782481191","66|_d2e56c2f-3362-4a0d-85f3-a381eb6ed077.jpg?